#- §7*sweetpea & ɨȶ stand at the top of The Deathcap Lighthouse*§r

§6Are you checking on me? I'm fine. Just admiring the view...§r
§5Beautiful... 
for something so dangerous.§r
§6Something that won't be here much longer...§r
§5I was talking 
about you...
#- §6╔═.✵.════════╗§r
     §5The Afterlife!§r
§6╚════════.✵.═╝
§8I am here in my office, it is so quiet now. Candlelight dancing on the edge of all the objects i've gathered up, packed up, in the hope they may come with me. The objects that have defined my existence. My thoughts venture into the dark,§r
#- §8and what is coming. What awaits me beyond the veil, my next life.

This life has been... well... seasoned by many trials and tribulations, chaos and order, good and evil, sorrow and joy. 
I am almost exicted to move on, unburdened, but the nostalgia is stronger.§r 
#- §8Will I be reborn into a world that respects magic, or fears magic?

I will miss the thrill of weaving in and out of trouble. Unlocking parts of a truth that's not quite complete. The exhilaration of dancing on the edge of power. The chaotic beauty of it all!§r
#- §8But I have to admit. Confess. I yearn for a better life. After the twists and turns of my current existence that have shaped me, I long for 
a peaceful, normal one. Just as I did at the start of these magazines. A gentler life. This is only the start! I hope... if§r §0The Darkness§r §8allows.§r
#- §8And if§r §5ɨȶ§r§8 is there with me... I intend to find out who he really is...§r

§6Don't think I've 
forgot about that!§r
§5We shall see...
§r 
