#- §2Dear Sweetpea,
As the end is near, I find it strangely fitting to pen this farewell letter. Who would have thought that a scientist and a witch would end up in this cosmic comedy? Our relationship began like mixing oil and water, a volatile concoction. We could never see eye to eye.§r
#- §2Yet, as impending doom looms, I feel it's time to admit that your magic was... quite something. Maybe my 'hypothesis' about you was a tad premature. You can't read it! I told Bot to put it in the paper shredder. While our debates on magic vs science could fill a library, I shall cherish the§r
#- §2memories of our collaborative endeavors. I kind of liked the chaos of your curses, truly an art form, or should I say, a dark science? I'll miss our bickering! §mIf we survive, I might get you to teach me a curse or two, (for research purposes...)§r §2I mean... magic is fake,
SCIENCE IS REAL!!!§r§r 
