#- §5╔═.✵.════════╗  §2        ᴇᴘɪʟᴏɢᴜᴇ
§5╚════════.✵.═╝
§2Inside a dim-lit chamber, Queen Fern lay on her deathbed. Her once fiery eyes now softened by the passage of time. Gathered around her were loyal subjects and cherished friends, their expressions a mix of§r
#- §2grief and reverence for the famous 'Emerald Princess'. 

Someone was missing. Castien Morlana. 

Her now infamous King. 
Nobody dared to speak of him with 
Fern so frail. 

But I did...§r
#- §6"My Queen, why does Castien, your true love, not stand by your side in these final moments?"§r

§2"You are not meant to be here Sweetpea... that's cheating" Fern said with a small smirk.

I hesitated, avoiding her gaze.§r §6"I never find out the end of his§r
#- §6story... I thought..."§r

§2Fern sighed, her gaze drifting to the old Witch-Craft magazines§r §5ɨȶ§r §2gave her as a child in the snow so very long ago.§r§r "§0The Darkness§r §2my sweet, it has always been here since the start, not just the end. Always seeking rebirth. Now through me..."§r
#- §2Confused glances exchanged among the onlookers as Fern adressed everyone.

"I am a Flower Maiden, made of flowers and magic by my mother Marigold. Sweetpea is just like me. Our petals are intertwined with all the memories of battles waged and victories won. As I§r
#- §2fade away,§r The Darkness §2will claim me, and I shall be reborn again!"

Fern took my hand.

A hushed awe settled in the room, broke by a faint hint of static, then dark smoke and glitching particles in the air. I let go and took a big step back.§r 
#- §2Fern, in her final moments, exuded a delicate radiance, her body slowly transforming into a cascade of petals that drifted into the air. As the petals dispersed, and otherworldly quiet settled upon the room. Honey the bee emerged, hovering briefly before§r
#- §2succumbing to the same fate. Dissolving into dust. The air shimmered with a magical and dark energy and everyone watched as Fern's soul became one with§r The Darkness§2. In the silence that followed, the room remained adorned with the scent of flowers as I made my swift exit.§r
#- §2To be continued???
§5✿✿❀❀❀✿✿.✿✿❀❀❀✿✿

§2Tune in next time 
for more of... 
ꜰᴇʀɴ'ꜱ ᴀᴅᴠᴇɴᴛᴜʀᴇꜱ!

The story is not over.
In fact, it's just started...

Fern will return 
in season 5.
