#- §6I never got to find out what happened to Castien. I know, that I won't... because I can't remember the story... which means, I don't find out, which means...§r The Darkness §6takes me as well. And very soon.§r

§5I find it amazing that you were there for her, at the end.§r
#- §5Maybe it's for the best you don't...§r
§6Why? Do you know something I don't?§r
§5My dear, I always know something you do not!§r
§6Oh yeah... you are the 'ancient evil cursed entity' that was meant to be the 'bad guy'.§r
§5People can change...§r
§6Would it be wrong of me to want you...
to never change?§r
