#- §d╔═.☠.════════╗§r
§5§  The One To Survive!§r§r
§d╚════════.☠.═╝§r
§5You wanted to know more about me... about ɨȶ. I can't say much, for that brings to much pain. One day I might share my story.

In the eons that stretch beyond mortal comprehension, I am ɨȶ, the timeless enitity.
#- §5Witness to all existence. Immortality, an elusive gift, has rendered me immune to§r The Darkness§5. I fade away... but not fully.

I don't have the cycle of death and rebirth mortals cling to. I carry the weight of ages, each memory etched into my skin. Time unfolds before§r
#- §5me, every joy and every sorrow. I am past, present and future all at the same time. This is the bittersweet truth of who I am. What I am.

My lust for power, for chaos, made me unable to partake in the 'reset' that grants renewal to weary souls. Mine can't rest.§r
#- §5Yet, amidst this expanse...§r §6Sweetpea§r §5stands out as a singular... an anomaly.
For some reason, in this life, she was a beacon that called me. With her, I saw with new eye's. A gift, of feeling more alive within the ceaseless current of time. I want her as my everlasting companion...§r
#- 





     §5I will miss her...§r
