#- ╔═.☠.════════╗
§     Out With A Bang!
╚════════.☠.═╝
§6Sweetpea§r stayed on top of that giant mushroom for what felt like hours. Awaiting the end of the world. She thought of all those people see cared for. The CEO, Dr. Link, Bot... the list goes on too long. The sky was full of
#- stars like little lights shimmering on a deep void black blanket. As she waited, she clutched her now most prized possession; an old enchanted necklace, holding many memories. A shadowy crow came from the darkened sky, it's ebony feathers contrasting with the purples of the witch.
#- Intrigued as always, she followed the crow to Deathcap Graveyard where an eerie stillness hung in the air. She went towards the tall grave that was always fenced off. To her shock, she triggered something and out popped her own lifeless body. A chill ran down her spine as 
#- she gazed upon her lifeless form, confused and disoriented, she felt the wave of impending doom. The crow flew down and snatched the necklace from her neck before she could even blink. Panic set in as the crow took flight, leaving her alone and vulnerable. Then, a thunderous
#- explosion echoed through the whole island. A flash of purple and green.§6§r 

§6Sweetpea§r, resighed to her fate, uttered defiantly; §6"the joke is on you §0Darkness§r... §6that necklace was fool's gold!"§§

§0In that moment, the explosion consumed§r
#- her. §6Sweetpea§r and Deathcap were gone.
§6§r
Yet, as the dust settled and the last remains of Craftadia fell to The Darkness, her ethereal laughter came from the fake necklace the crow had taken. §6Sweetpea§r had left a hint of laughter and joy, even in the face of §5chaos§r...
